      "name": "pvsneslib",
      "description": "Comprehensive C-based SNES development SDK. Includes 816-tcc compiler, linker, graphics/audio tools, and runtime libraries. Enables high-level C programming for SNES with built-in sprite, background, input, and sound handling. The primary SDK for SNES-IDE projects.",
